        "Ranked multi-model cascade (gemini-3.1-flash-lite, gemini-3.6-flash, etc.) handles rate limits",
        "Resilient JSON parser (extractJSON) strips markdown fences and repairs boundary bracket truncations",
        "Zero-downtime deterministic rule engine (evaluateDirectiveRules) guarantees treatment if cloud fails"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Adaptive Mid-Session Feedback Loop",
      "items": [
        "Autonomous mid-session agent (getMidSessionAdjustment) fires at exactly 50% duration checkpoint",
        "Biofeedback branches: Better maintains settings; Same steps vibration (+2); Worse shifts to calming audio",
        "Real-time parameter recalibration executed without interrupting running therapy or resetting timers"
      ]
    },
